					"speakerTitle": "曼科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750080215,
					"content": "#那可不行，我們是要用來救{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750080216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750080216,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750080217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750080217,
					"content": "#我知道…接下來{F#妳}{M#你}們就要前往圖蘭大火山了吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750080218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "曼科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750080218,
					"content": "傳說從前在希巴拉克尚未成為火神之時，與執掌光與熱的焰主在其中戰鬥…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750080219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "曼科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750080219,
					"content": "最後，成功活著回來的勇士希巴拉克成為了最初的火神。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750080220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "曼科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750080220,
					"content": "不過火山裡面有什麼就沒有人知道了，有人說裡面藏著休眠中未死的古龍，也有人說裡面被希巴拉克的火焰焚燒，空空如也。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750080221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "曼科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750080221,
					"content": "我覺得這些大概都只是敘事人的臆測…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750080222
					],
					"speakerTitle": "曼科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750080222,
					"content": "雖然很想一起去，不過那對我這副身軀來說還是太勉強了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
